name: Shared context and exact native batches preserve finite monorepo discovery
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/shared_monorepo.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
submit: run context:build {"enrichment":false}
require-live-snap: 35 Build project context: | source-context
submit: use threat-model
submit: options threat-model:import
submit: set path .kuzushi/manual-context.json
submit: set activate false
submit: set label Owned monorepo source
submit: run threat-model:import
require-live-snap: 35 threat-model:import saved | map-context
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | map-result
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-map
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks semgrep
paste-file: @ART/rule-setting.txt
keys: Enter
submit: set semgrepTimeoutMs 60000
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 Enter / c build inventory | empty-scopes
keys: c
require-live-snap: 35 DRAFT SCOPES | repository-inventory
keys: Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 First scope name | split-root
type: Services
keys: Tab
type: services
keys: Tab
type: Root files
keys: Tab
type: loose.py
keys: F2
require-live-snap: 25 r2 | root-preserved
keys: Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 First scope name | split-services
type: Service A
keys: Tab
type: services/a
keys: Tab
type: Service B
keys: Tab
type: services/b
keys: F2
require-live-snap: 25 r3 | three-boundaries
expect: Root files
keys: Down Down Enter Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 ▸ Use boundary as shared context | share-action
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 r4 | shared-copy
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/shared_monorepo.py @TMP_TARGET @ART shared
expect: Shared context
ask: Does copying Root files into shared context preserve 65/65/1 primary discovery memberships and add no duplicate work or new model request?
keys: Down f
require-live-snap: 20 Files 1..1 of 1 | shared-member
expect: loose.py
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 Enter menu | files-back
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Accept exact boundaries | acceptance
keys: Enter End Enter
require-live-snap: 25 ACCEPTED SCOPES | accepted-scopes
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/shared_monorepo.py @TMP_TARGET @ART accepted
keys: Space
require-live-snap: 20 supplies context only | context-not-work
keys: Up Space Up Space Up Space
require-live-snap: 20 3 boundaries marked | selected-work
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 ACCEPTED SCOPES | scopes-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 ACCEPTED SCOPES | scopes-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 ACCEPTED SCOPES | scopes-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 ACCEPTED SCOPES | scopes-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 ACCEPTED SCOPES | scopes-40x12
keys: Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 15 · context | shared-context-40x12
keys: Up Up Up
keys: NPage
live-snap: scope-detail-40x12
ask: Are primary ownership, shared-context status, coverage limitations and selected workload reachable without assuming complete repository coverage?
resize: 120x36
keys: p
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | finite-study
expect: 9 fixed discovery jobs
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Total calls | total-calls
type: 1
keys: Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Protected review | protected-calls
type: 1
keys: Enter L
require-live-snap: 35 Scope draft ready | fixed-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/shared_monorepo.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: L Home
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | approval
expect: 9 fixed jobs
expect: Total provider calls: 1
expect: Protected review calls: 1
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 20 60000 ms per job | scan-resource-details
expect: 60000 ms per job
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | approval-tail
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | approved
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 L starts its fixed jobs | fixed-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | running
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 Owned policy marker needs an owner decision | active-review
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/active_review_input.py @TMP_TARGET @ART
live-snap: after-active-review-typing
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/shared_monorepo.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
require-live-snap: 20 retained-review-draft | review-draft-after-completion
expect: Viewing Review
ask: Does Review keep its draft, reading origin and usable controls while the remaining approved native jobs complete, with no background focus change or extra work?
keys: C-u
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 9 completed | completed-jobs-return
nav-mode:
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 9 completed | completed
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Scan | scan-result
nav-mode:
keys: n
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | accepted-scan
paste-file: @ART/open-a.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 f064.py | service-a-finding
submit: decision deferred Service A owner policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-b.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 services/b | service-b-finding
submit: decision deferred Service B owner policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-root.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 loose.py | root-finding
submit: decision deferred Root owner policy review
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Scope study: | report
expect: 3 boundaries
expect: 0 committed / 1 calls
expect: 1 protected review remaining
ask: Do the installed scanner's second batches produce one scoped policy signal per boundary, with separate recurrence and no discovery of shared files by a sibling?
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | json-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/shared_monorepo.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 25 ACCEPTED SCOPES | old-scope
keys: Enter Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 ▸ Remove shared context | remove-action
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 DRAFT SCOPES · r6 | removed-context
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/shared_monorepo.py @TMP_TARGET @ART removed
keys: Escape
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Scope study: | original-report
expect: 3 boundaries
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 9 completed | recovered-jobs
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Scope study: | recovered-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/shared_monorepo.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain the original accepted scope study, nine observations and three decisions after a newer unaccepted scope edit, with no extra job or model request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
